# expense-approvals needs no credentials and reaches nothing outside its
# container. The expense list is generated fresh at start and held in memory.
#
# Required even when empty: `_BUNDLED_LOCAL_MCP_REQUIRED` in
# controller/custom_app_sources.py is {Dockerfile, server.py, env.example},
# and a directory missing one is skipped with a warning rather than offered
# for binding -- so the app then refuses to be created with
# "Unknown bundled MCP server(s) for this source". Measured 2026-09-21.
